# Play test of the plan 'Raft Remade' (CIPlay plan_raft_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'): Raft's story from its start;
# every story island's place is taken by its remade version, found on the Receiver, played to its end with its own
# test - and its quest done unlocks the next one.
plan Raft Remade
note RadioTower
expect chain radioremade unlocked
tune radioremade
include radio_tower_remade.play
expect chain radioremade done
expect chain vasagatanremade unlocked
tune vasagatanremade
include vasagatan_remade.play
expect chain vasagatanremade done
expect chain balboaremade unlocked
tune balboaremade
include balboa_remade.play
expect chain balboaremade done
expect chain caravanremade unlocked
tune caravanremade
include caravan_town_remade.play
expect chain caravanremade done
expect chain tangaroaremade unlocked
tune tangaroaremade
include tangaroa_remade.play
expect chain tangaroaremade done
expect chain varunaremade unlocked
tune varunaremade
include varuna_point_remade.play
expect chain varunaremade done
expect chain temperanceremade unlocked
tune temperanceremade
include temperance_remade.play
expect chain temperanceremade done
expect chain utopiaremade unlocked
tune utopiaremade
include utopia_remade.play
expect chain utopiaremade done
expect blueprints
plan end
